---
description: Enforce testing standards when creating or modifying source files
globs: src/**/*.ts
---

When creating or modifying any source file under src/:

1. **Test file required** — every file at src/lib/*.ts must have a corresponding test at src/__tests__/*.test.ts
2. **Test structure** — use describe/it blocks from @jest/globals, not global jest
3. **Edge cases** — every function must have at least one edge-case test (empty input, boundary values, error paths)
4. **No mocks for DB** — use real SQLite for integration tests; only mock external HTTP calls
5. **Naming** — test descriptions must start with a verb: "returns", "throws", "calculates", etc.
